{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q415856","formula":"NiAsS","hill":"AsNiS","elements":["S","Ni","As"],"composition":{"S":1.0,"As":1.0,"Ni":1.0},"names":{"en":"Gersdorffite","ru":"Герсдорфит","uk":"Герсдорфіт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Gersdorffite or Nickel glance (trivial name) is a nickel arsenic sulfide mineral with formula NiAsS. It crystallizes in the isometric system showing diploidal symmetry. It occurs as euhedral to massive opaque, metallic grey-black to silver white forms. Gersdorffite belongs to a solid solution series with cobaltite, CoAsS. Antimony freely substitutes also leading to ullmannite, NiSbS. It has a Mohs hardness of 5.5 and a specific gravity of 5.9 to 6.33.","ru":"Герсдорфи́т (нем. Gersdorffit) или ни́келевый блеск (калька с нем. Nickelglanz), иногда также никелево-мышьяковый блеск — минерал, сульфоарсенид никеля состава NiAsS. Герсдорфит образует серии твёрдых растворов с кобальтином (CoAsS) и ульманнитом (NiSbS).","uk":"Герсдорфіт (рос. герсдорфит; англ. gersdorffite; нім."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-3830","atoms":12,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[5.674,0.0,0.0],[0.0,5.674,0.0],[0.0,0.0,5.674]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":5.646,"y":0.028,"z":2.866,"el":"Ni"},{"x":0.028,"y":2.866,"z":5.646,"el":"Ni"},{"x":2.809,"y":2.809,"z":2.809,"el":"Ni"},{"x":2.866,"y":5.646,"z":0.028,"el":"Ni"},{"x":4.999,"y":3.513,"z":2.162,"el":"As"},{"x":2.162,"y":4.999,"z":3.513,"el":"As"},{"x":0.675,"y":0.675,"z":0.675,"el":"As"},{"x":3.513,"y":2.162,"z":4.999,"el":"As"},{"x":0.651,"y":2.186,"z":3.488,"el":"S"},{"x":3.488,"y":0.651,"z":2.186,"el":"S"},{"x":2.186,"y":3.488,"z":0.651,"el":"S"},{"x":5.023,"y":5.023,"z":5.023,"el":"S"}],"bonds":[[2,10,1],[0,9,1],[1,8,1],[2,8,